{"id":"5f53820d5f875310","group":"58","path":"58/batch14/58-df-zfc-measure9-counting-measure.md","title":"ZFC Measure9 Counting Measure","display":"df-zfc-measure9-counting-measure — ZFC Measure9 Counting Measure","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-measure9-counting-measure","aliases":["58-df-zfc-measure9-counting-measure"],"display":"df-zfc-measure9-counting-measure — ZFC Measure9 Counting Measure","depends_on":["[[../batch13/58-df-measure.md]]","[[../batch09/58-df-powerset.md]]","[[../batch04/58-df-finite.md]]","[[../batch01/58-df-equinumerous.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-omega.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-measure9-counting-measure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-measure9-counting-measure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-measure9-counting-measure — ZFC Measure9 Counting Measure"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ca832ed6bc22f728\" href=\"?note=ca832ed6bc22f728\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-measure.md\">../batch13/58-df-measure.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2b6b1d9eb78a2714\" href=\"?note=2b6b1d9eb78a2714\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-powerset.md\">../batch09/58-df-powerset.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d9a25b0ac94a3598\" href=\"?note=d9a25b0ac94a3598\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-finite.md\">../batch04/58-df-finite.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"28c79fde9f892bfe\" href=\"?note=28c79fde9f892bfe\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-equinumerous.md\">../batch01/58-df-equinumerous.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5045d216c83e75cb\" href=\"?note=5045d216c83e75cb\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-omega.md\">../batch16/58-df-omega.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\mu\\in V\">\\(X,\\mu\\in V\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Measure}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Measure}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P\">\\(\\mathcal P\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Finite}\">\\(\\mathrm{Finite}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\approx\">\\(\\approx\\)</span> are as in <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"ca832ed6bc22f728\" href=\"?note=ca832ed6bc22f728\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-measure.md\">../batch13/58-df-measure.md</a>, <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"2b6b1d9eb78a2714\" href=\"?note=2b6b1d9eb78a2714\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-powerset.md\">../batch09/58-df-powerset.md</a>, <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"d9a25b0ac94a3598\" href=\"?note=d9a25b0ac94a3598\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-finite.md\">../batch04/58-df-finite.md</a>, and <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"28c79fde9f892bfe\" href=\"?note=28c79fde9f892bfe\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-equinumerous.md\">../batch01/58-df-equinumerous.md</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure9CountingMeasure}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure9CountingMeasure}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\approx B\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Equinumerous}_S(A,B)\">\\(A\\approx B\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Equinumerous}_S(A,B)\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"28c79fde9f892bfe\" href=\"?note=28c79fde9f892bfe\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-equinumerous.md\">../batch01/58-df-equinumerous.md</a>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota_{\\mathbb R}\\in\\mathbb R^\\omega\">\\(\\iota_{\\mathbb R}\\in\\mathbb R^\\omega\\)</span> 是满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota_{\\mathbb R}(0)=0_{\\mathbb R}\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(\\iota_{\\mathbb R}(n+1)=\\iota_{\\mathbb R}(n)+_{\\mathbb R}1_{\\mathbb R})\">\\(\\iota_{\\mathbb R}(0)=0_{\\mathbb R}\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;(\\iota_{\\mathbb R}(n+1)=\\iota_{\\mathbb R}(n)+_{\\mathbb R}1_{\\mathbb R})\\)</span> 的唯一函数；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0_{\\mathbb R},1_{\\mathbb R},+_{\\mathbb R}\">\\(0_{\\mathbb R},1_{\\mathbb R},+_{\\mathbb R}\\)</span> 为所用实域的零元、单位元和加法。自然数指标仍为 von Neumann 自然数，测度值使用此嵌入。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure9\\text{-}counting\\text{-}measure} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure9CountingMeasure}_S(X,\\mu)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mu,X,\\mathcal P(X))\\land\n\\forall A\\subseteq X\\;\\Bigl(\n(\\mathrm{Finite}(A)\\land\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;(A\\approx n\\land\\mu(A)=\\iota_{\\mathbb R}(n)))\n\\lor(\\neg\\mathrm{Finite}(A)\\land\\mu(A)=\\infty)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure9\\text{-}counting\\text{-}measure} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure9CountingMeasure}_S(X,\\mu)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mu,X,\\mathcal P(X))\\land\n\\forall A\\subseteq X\\;\\Bigl(\n(\\mathrm{Finite}(A)\\land\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;(A\\approx n\\land\\mu(A)=\\iota_{\\mathbb R}(n)))\n\\lor(\\neg\\mathrm{Finite}(A)\\land\\mu(A)=\\infty)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Infinite subsets receive value <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\infty\">\\(\\infty\\)</span>; the former cardinal-valued clause did not type as an extended-real measure.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch13/58-df-measure.md","status":"resolved","id":"ca832ed6bc22f728","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-measure.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-powerset.md","status":"resolved","id":"2b6b1d9eb78a2714","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-powerset.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-finite.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9a25b0ac94a3598","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-finite.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-df-equinumerous.md","status":"resolved","id":"28c79fde9f892bfe","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-equinumerous.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-omega.md","status":"resolved","id":"5045d216c83e75cb","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-omega.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-measure.md","status":"resolved","id":"ca832ed6bc22f728","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Measure}_S$, $\\mathcal P$, $\\mathrm{Finite}$, and $\\approx$ are as in [[../batch13/58-df-measure.md]], [[../batch09/58-df-powerset.md]], [[../batch04/58-df-finite.md]], and [[../batch01/58-df-equinumerous.md]].","embed":false},{"target":"../batc